[[:db/retract 17592186122192 :answer-field/choices 17592186122193] [:db/retract 17592186122192 :answer-field/choices 17592186122194] [:db/retract 17592186122192 :answer-field/choices 17592186122195] [:db/retract 17592186122192 :answer-field/choices 17592186122196] [:db/retract 17592186122192 :answer-field/choices 17592186122197] {:db/id 17592186124932 :question/problem "Find ${f}_{xy}(x,y)+{f}_{yx}(x,y)$ given that  ${f}_{x}(x,y)=2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y$ and ${f}_{y}(x,y)={x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y.$" :question/worked-solution "To find ${f}_{xy}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${f}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({f}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y) \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find ${f}_{yx}(x,y)$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative ${f}_{y}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{yx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{y}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y) \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xy}(x,y)+{f}_{yx}(x,y) & =2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y \\\\  & =4x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186122192 :answer-field/correct "answer-2ea483d9-4903-536f-a106-b11346fafb16" :answer-field/choices ["answer-654452d8-a947-5e7b-b22c-8a13e2ef81d0" "answer-01b1340c-9ea7-510e-a7fe-a5318d1aa165" "answer-2ea483d9-4903-536f-a106-b11346fafb16" "answer-646a4289-2437-5a76-800d-038e82b06562" "answer-6b0fbde1-6b7d-56c5-b32e-24ed9e9df6a2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-654452d8-a947-5e7b-b22c-8a13e2ef81d0" :answer/id #uuid "654452d8-a947-5e7b-b22c-8a13e2ef81d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x(\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+\\operatorname{sin}⁡y)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-01b1340c-9ea7-510e-a7fe-a5318d1aa165" :answer/id #uuid "01b1340c-9ea7-510e-a7fe-a5318d1aa165" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2ea483d9-4903-536f-a106-b11346fafb16" :answer/id #uuid "2ea483d9-4903-536f-a106-b11346fafb16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-646a4289-2437-5a76-800d-038e82b06562" :answer/id #uuid "646a4289-2437-5a76-800d-038e82b06562" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(\\operatorname{cos}⁡y-\\operatorname{sin}⁡y)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6b0fbde1-6b7d-56c5-b32e-24ed9e9df6a2" :answer/id #uuid "6b0fbde1-6b7d-56c5-b32e-24ed9e9df6a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186124442 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-11508c24-c4aa-589a-b2fa-c4b12396bfe7" "question-fdce2d33-30de-52e0-89c4-590147a8c4ea"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186124939 :question/problem "Calculate ${f}_{xyx}(x,y)$ given that $f(x,y)={x}^{2}y+{y}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the first-order derivative ${f}_{x}(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}y+{y}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y) \\\\  & =2xy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we find ${f}_{xy}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({f}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2xy) \\\\  & =2x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we find ${f}_{xyx}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{xy}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xyx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{xy}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2x) \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186122234 :answer-field/correct 17592186122236 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "question-11508c24-c4aa-589a-b2fa-c4b12396bfe7" :question/id #uuid "11508c24-c4aa-589a-b2fa-c4b12396bfe7" :question/math-academy-id "q-65070" :question/problem "Calculate ${f}_{xyx}(x,y)$ given that $f(x,y)={x}^{2}{y}^{2}+y{e}^{x}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the first-order derivative ${f}_{x}(x,y):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}{y}^{2}+y{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =2x\\cdot {y}^{2}+y\\cdot {e}^{x} \\\\  & =2x{y}^{2}+y{e}^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we find ${f}_{xy}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({f}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2x{y}^{2}+y{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =2x\\cdot 2y+1\\cdot {e}^{x} \\\\  & =4xy+{e}^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we find ${f}_{xyx}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${f}_{xy}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xyx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{xy}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(4xy+{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot 1\\cdot y+{e}^{x} \\\\  & =4y+{e}^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-31dfaa29-640a-5223-927a-6d7e182b7cd8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-31dfaa29-640a-5223-927a-6d7e182b7cd8" :answer-field/id #uuid "31dfaa29-640a-5223-927a-6d7e182b7cd8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-07b7ad2e-54cc-50e3-9ca3-0b8efd17be6d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-44455996-432d-5a3d-8b99-8ba088ea40bc" "answer-1f109dc7-15d8-584f-8e2b-595762c1a061" "answer-07b7ad2e-54cc-50e3-9ca3-0b8efd17be6d" "answer-5e886d04-bc8d-58c5-9141-d4629aa452fc" "answer-e3c5be38-2517-52b4-89a2-e748dfb3f71f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-44455996-432d-5a3d-8b99-8ba088ea40bc" :answer/id #uuid "44455996-432d-5a3d-8b99-8ba088ea40bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2xy+{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1f109dc7-15d8-584f-8e2b-595762c1a061" :answer/id #uuid "1f109dc7-15d8-584f-8e2b-595762c1a061" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4xy+y{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-07b7ad2e-54cc-50e3-9ca3-0b8efd17be6d" :answer/id #uuid "07b7ad2e-54cc-50e3-9ca3-0b8efd17be6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4y+{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5e886d04-bc8d-58c5-9141-d4629aa452fc" :answer/id #uuid "5e886d04-bc8d-58c5-9141-d4629aa452fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x{y}^{2}+y{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e3c5be38-2517-52b4-89a2-e748dfb3f71f" :answer/id #uuid "e3c5be38-2517-52b4-89a2-e748dfb3f71f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y+x+{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-fdce2d33-30de-52e0-89c4-590147a8c4ea" :question/id #uuid "fdce2d33-30de-52e0-89c4-590147a8c4ea" :question/math-academy-id "q-80479" :question/problem "Calculate ${g}_{xxy}(x,y)$ given that $g(x,y)=({x}^{2}+y)\\operatorname{sin}⁡({y}^{2}).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the first-order derivative ${g}_{x}(x,y):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{x}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(({x}^{2}+y)\\operatorname{sin}⁡({y}^{2})) \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡({y}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we find ${g}_{x}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${g}_{x}(x,y)$ with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xx}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({g}_{x}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡({y}^{2})) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({y}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we find ${g}_{xxy}(x,y)$ by differentiating ${g}_{xx}(x,y)$ with respect to $y:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{xxy}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({g}_{xx}(x,y)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({y}^{2})) \\\\  & =4y\\operatorname{cos}⁡({y}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1a95cb7d-93f6-5084-ade9-1c85a3b6b1f1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1a95cb7d-93f6-5084-ade9-1c85a3b6b1f1" :answer-field/id #uuid "1a95cb7d-93f6-5084-ade9-1c85a3b6b1f1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d1afdc0c-1cf1-54cf-9c95-d81dfb59dc49" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1c70e303-c80e-51d2-8821-2af0cf8b3950" "answer-ca872c1a-6f89-5f8b-8336-d7cb854e1bcb" "answer-d1afdc0c-1cf1-54cf-9c95-d81dfb59dc49" "answer-992b5993-493b-561e-9033-5437b3de59e0" "answer-92245356-2a0e-55cd-8484-17313be9c3ed"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1c70e303-c80e-51d2-8821-2af0cf8b3950" :answer/id #uuid "1c70e303-c80e-51d2-8821-2af0cf8b3950" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2y\\operatorname{cos}⁡({y}^{2})-x\\operatorname{sin}⁡({y}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ca872c1a-6f89-5f8b-8336-d7cb854e1bcb" :answer/id #uuid "ca872c1a-6f89-5f8b-8336-d7cb854e1bcb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4x{y}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({y}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d1afdc0c-1cf1-54cf-9c95-d81dfb59dc49" :answer/id #uuid "d1afdc0c-1cf1-54cf-9c95-d81dfb59dc49" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4y\\operatorname{cos}⁡({y}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-992b5993-493b-561e-9033-5437b3de59e0" :answer/id #uuid "992b5993-493b-561e-9033-5437b3de59e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({y}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-92245356-2a0e-55cd-8484-17313be9c3ed" :answer/id #uuid "92245356-2a0e-55cd-8484-17313be9c3ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({y}^{2})-2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡({y}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-59407835-7bfb-56b8-b3fd-56d3687982eb" :activity/id #uuid "59407835-7bfb-56b8-b3fd-56d3687982eb" :activity/title "Higher-Order Partial Derivatives" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048781 :activity/course 17592186046659 :activity/steps ["step-